0	section	Talking to Talia
1	line	Player	Hello, what is this place?
1	line	Talia	Welcome to our dog shelter! I'm Talia and I run it alongside my husband, Chase.
1	line	Player	You don't seem to have many dogs. Where are the rest?
1	line	Talia	I wish I could tell you they'd all been adopted... but I'd be lying to myself.
1	line	Player	So they were never here to begin with?
1	line	Chase	No.
1	line	Talia	We're trying. The monks from the Monastery believe in our cause. That's why they granted us this land.
1	line	Talia	But belief, sadly, won't help keep us open.
1	line	Player	What would you need to keep the shelter open?
1	line	Talia	We need more strays to rescue. If people know they can find a companion here, they'll come.
1	line	Player	Can't you go out to look for strays then?
1	line	Talia	We tried.
1	line	Player	What happened?
1	line	Talia	It can take one of us hours just to coerce a puppy out of hiding.
1	line	Chase	And the shelter doesn't run itself.
1	line	Talia	By the time we got back, we'd still need to clean the kennels, feed the dogs we do have, repair the fences...
1	line	Talia	Plus, there was no one to keep the cats and dogs separate.
1	line	Player	I thought this was a dog shelter?
1	line	Chase	Not always.
1	line	Talia	What we really need is someone worldly who can bring strays back for us.
1	cond	If the player does not meet the quest's requirements:
2	line	Player	Sounds like it. No luck in finding anyone then?
2	line	Talia	Sadly not.
2	action	end
1	cond	If the player meets the quest's requirements:
2	select	Start the A Ruff Situation quest?
2	option	Yes.
3	line	Player	Lucky for you, I enjoy wandering.
3	line	Chase	I can smell it.
3	line	Talia	So you'll help us out?
3	line	Player	I'd be happy to. Any ideas where I could start?
3	line	Talia	We've met so many people that might be able to...
3	line	Chase	Gertrude.
3	line	Talia	Yes, Gertrude! She was a great help with the cats.
3	line	Chase	Not much for dogs.
3	line	Talia	Right, but I'm sure she can point you in the right direction. You'll find her house near the western entrance to Varrock.
4	line	Player	Sure, I can check in with her.
4	action	continues
4	line	Player	Excellent idea. I've helped her out before. I can check in with her.
4	action	continues
3	line	Talia	Wonderful! Good luck!
3	action	end
2	option	No.
3	line	Player	I'm afraid I can't help you at the moment.
3	action	end
