0	section	Gertrude
1	select	Select an option
1	option	Ask about lost dogs.
2	cond	If Gertrude's Cat has been completed:
3	line	Player	Hello there, Gertrude.
3	line	Gertrude	Hello, adventurer! How can I help you today?
3	line	Player	I've come to ask a favour, if you don't mind?
3	line	Gertrude	Of course, anything for the hero who returned Fluffs to me.
3	line	Player	Talia sent me to you. She said you helped them with their dog shelter?
3	line	Gertrude	It's just a dog shelter now? I don't blame them... They had trouble keeping the cats and dogs separate. How have they been getting on?
3	line	Player	Not well. They barely have any dogs in for adoption.
3	line	Gertrude	Oh dear... I suppose that's why you're here?
3	line	Player	Precisely! They thought you might know of some dogs in the city I could rescue.
3	line	Gertrude	Well, it would be nice for someone to do something about those mangy stray dogs you see in Varrock.
3	line	Player	I wouldn't call them mangy... They just need some love.
3	line	Gertrude	They're covered in fleas and they're everywhere. They always beg for food when I walk through the city.
3	line	Player	Sounds like the kind of rescue Talia would be looking for...
3	line	Gertrude	I'd be happy to see them go. I always see them near the west entrance to the city.
3	line	Player	I'll start my search there then. You've been a great help!
3	action	end
2	cond	If Gertrude's Cat hasn't been completed:
