0	section	Goblins
1	line	Toetaller	What mean Picklenose lose other dog?
1	line	Picklenose	Picklenose jumped by big dog.
1	line	Toetaller	How big?
1	line	Picklenose	Bigger than Nosorog.
1	line	Toetaller	Ooh, big big! Toetaller understand now.
1	line	Stray Dog	Bark bark!
1	line	Player	Ahem!
1	line	Toetaller	Hello, human. What you want?
1	line	Picklenose	There! Big dog!
1	line	Toetaller	This dog?
1	line	Stray Dog	Woof!
1	line	Picklenose	Yes.
1	line	Toetaller	It not big as Nosorog... Picklenose lie.
1	line	Player	It bigger before.
1	line	Toetaller	Toetaller doubt that.
1	line	Player	Picklenose not lie! Dog bigger before.
1	line	Player	Excuse me!
1	line	Toetaller	Human rude. Goblins busy. Speak quick.
1	line	Player	Why did you steal these puppies? You need to give them back.
1	line	Toetaller	Sorry, human. We have big plan. Keep village safe.
1	line	Player	Puppies will keep your village safe?
1	line	Picklenose	Silly human.
1	line	Toetaller	Very silly. Puppy too weak. We wait 'till puppy big, strong.
1	line	Picklenose	Big, strong, scary dog keep village safe.
1	line	Player	You're just going to wait here till the puppy is fully grown?
1	line	Toetaller	Yes. Not take long Toetaller think.
1	line	Player	I'm afraid puppies don't work like that.
1	line	Picklenose	What human mean?
1	line	Player	You know you have to feed dogs to keep them alive?
1	line	Toetaller	No...
1	line	Player	They also have a lot of energy they need to burn off.
1	line	Picklenose	How do that?
1	line	Player	You need to play with them, take them for walks...
1	line	Picklenose	That sound boring.
1	line	Player	I wouldn't expect a dog to sit and guard your village all day either.
1	line	Toetaller	Why not?
1	line	Player	It's a dog. It needs attention and caring for. It won't just sit still for hours.
1	line	Toetaller	Hmm...
1	line	Player	Maybe a guard dog isn't the best idea?
1	line	Toetaller	No, Toetaller still want guard dog. We make this one guard dog without all that.
1	line	Player	If you don't feed it, it will die.
1	line	Toetaller	Toetaller don't think so.
1	line	Picklenose	Picklenose have idea.
1	line	Player	Oh, here we go...
1	line	Picklenose	Human find goblins dog that no need all that... extra stuff, then goblins give human this useless dog.
1	line	Player	I don't think a dog like that exists...
1	line	Toetaller	Then we do goblin plan.
1	line	Player	Wait, wait! Could I make you something?
1	line	Picklenose	Picklenose no know, can you?
1	line	Player	Maybe I could make something with some fur...?
1	line	Toetaller	Remember dog need be big... huge!
1	line	Picklenose	Yes, huge and scary. Defend village from outsiders.
1	line	Player	... Then I suppose I'd need to stuff it with something, maybe grain...?
1	line	Toetaller	Dog intimidate invaders, save goblin lives.
1	line	Picklenose	Human even listen to goblins now?
1	line	Toetaller	More like Picklenose not worth listening to.
1	line	Player	... Then a needle and thread to put it together...
1	line	Player	Okay, I think I can make something better for you.
1	line	Toetaller	Human be quick. Goblins low attention span.
1	action	end
