1	line	Player	Looks like you're all in one piece. Let's get you somewhere safe.
1	cond	If the player doesn't have inventory space:
2	line	Player	I don't have room to take you right now. Give me a moment.
1	line	Player	Is that all of them?
1	line	Stray dog	Woof!
1	line	Player	That was a close call. That's the second time we got lucky and arrived just in time.
1	line	Stray dog	Arf!
1	line	Player	We can't let something like that happen again. I can take you and your puppies somewhere safe, if you'd like?
1	line	Stray dog	Mmm?
1	line	Player	It's not far from here. Follow me.
1	cond	If the player doesn't have all the puppies with them:
2	line	Stray dog	Woof woof!
2	line	Player	Oh right, we should bring all the puppies with us. Let's collect them from your den first.
2	action	end
1	cond	If the player has all the puppies with them:
2	line	Stray dog	Arf!
2	line	Player	You seem enthusiastic enough. Let's head out.
2	action	end
