0	section	Back at the shelter
1	line	Player	Talia, Chase! I have returned.
1	line	Talia	Adventurer! Who's this beautiful girl you've got with you?
1	line	Player	I found her in Varrock. She's one of the stray dogs.
1	line	Chase	Poor girl.
1	line	Player	We've been on quite the adventure together.
1	line	Talia	Really? What happened?
1	line	Player	When I found her, she was distraught. Her puppies had been stolen.
1	line	Chase	Who would do such a thing?
1	line	Player	Goblins.
1	line	Chase	Fair enough.
1	line	Player	But we managed to save them all!
1	line	Stray puppy	Yip!
1	line	Stray puppy	Yop!
1	line	Stray puppy	Yap yap!
1	line	Talia	Oh my goodness!
1	line	Chase	Quite the selection.
1	line	Player	Cute, aren't they.
1	line	Talia	Oh Chase, this is exactly what we need to keep the shelter going!
1	line	Talia	Are you sure they want to stay with us?
1	line	Stray Dog	Arf!
1	line	Player	I'm pretty sure that means yes at this point.
1	line	Talia	Wonderful, you will all be happy and safe here!
1	line	Stray dog	Arf arf.
1	line	Player	What's the matter, girl?
1	line	Stray dog	Woof!
1	line	Chase	She's not staying.
1	line	Talia	I don't think she likes it here...
1	line	Talia	It's okay girl, you'll be safe here and well cared for.
1	line	Stray dog	Whine.
1	line	Player	I don't think you'll be able to convince her, she's quite stubborn.
1	line	Chase	I like her already.
1	line	Talia	What kind of shelter would we be if we let a dog stay as a stray?
1	line	Guard	I might be able to help with that.
1	line	Guard	I'm one of the Varrock guards. We've grown fond of this old girl.
1	line	Stray Dog	Arf arf!
1	line	Player	I'd say she's happy to see you.
1	line	Talia	Would you be willing to adopt her for us?
1	line	Guard	She's proven her bravery, we'd be delighted to bring her into our ranks.
1	line	Talia	Thank you! We'll get you set up with some things for her, free of charge!
1	line	Chase	Free?
1	line	Talia	It's the least we can do.
1	line	Talia	Thank you, adventurer, this is just what the shelter needed!
1	line	Player	I do my best.
1	line	Talia	If you would ever like to adopt one of these puppies yourself, just talk to Chase and he'll help you out.
1	line	Chase	For a small fee.
1	line	Player	After all I've done?
1	line	Chase	Business is business.
1	action	end
0	section	Post-quest dialogue
1	line	Talia	Thank you once again, adventurer. You've really given us hope to keep going.
1	line	Player	Happy to help!
1	line	Talia	Wonderful, because our work has just begun!
1	line	Player	Huh?
1	line	Talia	Word has spread of our shelter and we've received letters about stray dogs across the world.
1	line	Talia	Chase has been keeping a log of all the reports. If you speak with him, he'll show you.
1	line	Player	What's in it for me?
1	line	Talia	Well, you'll be able to adopt any puppies you bring back.
1	action	end
